{title: Gloria al rey santo y justo}
{key: C}
{meta: category Alabanza}
{meta: sanpedro 366}
{meta: buenpastor 179}

{start_of_verse}
[C]Gloria al Rey, [F]Rey santo y [C]justo,
[F]Gloria al [C]Maestro, [F]en su trono en [G]Sión.[G7]
[C]Digno Maestro, [F]digno de alab[C]anzas,
[F]santo, [C]santo, [F]gloria y ho[G]nra a [C]Ti[A7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[D]Gloria al Rey, [G]Rey santo y [D]justo,
[G]Gloria al [D]Maestro, [G]en su trono en [A]Sión.[A7]
[D]Digno Maestro, [G]digno de alaba[D]nzas,
[G]santo, [D]santo, [G]gloria y ho[A]nra a [D]Ti[B7]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[E]Gloria al Rey, [A]Rey santo y [E]justo,
[A]Gloria al [E]Maestro, [A]en su trono en [B7]Sión.
[E]Digno Maestro, [A]digno de [E]alabanzas,
[A]santo, [E]santo, [A]gloria y ho[B7]nra a [E]Ti
{end_of_verse}
